          <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-brand font-semibold">Mid-Market</span>
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-1 tracking-tight">Peec AI</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted mb-3 mt-1">Custom pricing</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-body leading-relaxed mb-4">Used vs cited source split. 24-hour cadence. Looker Studio connector for in-house dashboards.</p>
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-muted font-semibold mt-auto pt-3 border-t border-ink/8">Best for: in-house marketing teams</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white border border-ink/8 rounded-xl shadow-card p-6 flex flex-col">
        <div class="inline-flex self-start items-center px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand/10 border border-brand/20 mb-3">
          <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-brand font-semibold">Accessible</span>
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-1 tracking-tight">Otterly AI</h4>
        <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink mb-3">$50<span class="text-sm text-muted font-medium">/mo</span></p>
